A Tolivane Amulet was once in the possession of [[Dante Vale]] and was given to [[Montehue]] in their youth. {{Source|Two Powers Become One}}

Tolivane was invoked by Montehue in the [[Temple of Thor]] to hold off the [[Guardians of Thor]] in order to allow Montuehue and Dante time to utilize [[Mjolnir]] to defeat [[Ymir]]. {{Source|Two Powers Become One}}

In [[Ethiopia]], Tolivane was invoked to defend Montehue against [[Ashtoreth]]. Later, inside [[King Solomon's mines]], Tolivane was invoked to defend against the [[the Organization]]'s forces. After absorbing a [[Suit]]'s [[Poisonfang]] attack, Tolivane was defeated by [[Rassimov]]'s [[Kopesh]]. {{Source|To Be Together}}
